EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Arizona State University allows you to defer your admission for only one semester, and you may defer admission only to the next consecutive semester. If you do not enroll in the next semester, you will have to reapply to ASU.

If you choose to defer your admission, please complete the attached form and email the deferment information to DeferUGAdmissions@asu.edu.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
